WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.808
Can, may, must, should and might signal ability, permission, duty, advice and

00:00:04.808 --> 00:00:05.192
possibility.

00:00:06.033 --> 00:00:08.743
Which modal expresses ability? Answer: can

00:00:10.033 --> 00:00:13.831
Write school rules using must and helpful suggestions using should.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.495
Discuss why: Can commonly expresses ability.
